    "preamble": "R.Kodikesavan vs State Through on 4 December, 2024 Author: N.Anand Venkatesh Bench: N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P.(MD)No.1 Before The Madurai Bench Of Madras High Court Dated: 04.12.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mr.Justice N.Anand Venkatesh Crl.O.P.(MD)No.14617 of 2022 and Crl.M.P.(MD) No.9473 of 2022 1.R.Kodikesavan 2.P. Rajan ... Pe Vs. 1.State through, The Food Safety Officer, Thoothukudi Corporation Zone - Ii, Thoothukudi District. 2.Kalimuthu (Age not known), (Father's name not known) Code No. 596, Zone Ii, Food Safety Officer, Thoothukudi Corporation, Thoothukudi District. ... Respo PRAYER : Criminal Original Petition filed under Section 4 Criminal Procedure Code, to call for the records in C.C.No. 195 of pending before the learned Judicial Magistrate No. II, Thoothukudi quash the same.",
